    <!-- main screen -->
    <string name="about_text">HTC HD2 (Qualcomm QSD8250, Scorpion) on QEMU\'s htcleo machine.\n\nThe picture comes from QEMU\'s VNC server on a socket inside this app\'s own directory, the keys and taps go back through QMP, and the sound is the VNC audio extension played by AudioTrack.\n\nWith a keyboard: F2 call, Home, F1 Windows, Esc back, F3 end, F12 power, Page Up / Page Down volume.\n\nNo Material anywhere: Theme.Holo, hand-drawn Holo widgets, and a framework-only build with no dependencies at all.</string>
