    <string name="set_clk_regime_sum">QEMU replies to the ADM_CLK proc_comm itself instead of the real AMSS, which livelocks on them and wedges the boot in the YAFFS2 mount. Turn off to see that stall; can go away once the kernel stops toggling the clock per datamover command.</string>
